OL,3,ABritish citizen among six killed in
OL,4,APolish mass shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British national is among six people
OL,7,Fkilled in the Krakow shooting, the
OL,8,Fcommander-in-chief of Poland's police,
OL,9,FMarek Boron, says
OL,11,FThe gunman who killed six people in an
OL,12,Fattack in Krakow is believed to have
OL,13,Fbeen inspired by "far-right
OL,14,Fideologies", Poland's interior minister
OL,15,Fsays
OL,17,FMarcin KierwiEDski says the suspect - a
OL,18,F25-year-old Polish citizen - is
OL,19,Fundergoing surgery after being shot by
OL,20,Fpolice
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
