OL,3,ABritish citizen among six killed in
OL,4,APolish mass shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSixteen people were injured in the
OL,7,Fattack, the minister says, including
OL,8,Fthe suspect, five foreign nationals and
OL,9,Ftwo police officers - here's a recap of
OL,10,Fwhat he said
OL,12,FHe adds that the suspect may have taken
OL,13,Fguns from the family's home and there
OL,14,Fare indications he held
OL,15,F"ultra-nationalist views" -
OL,16,Fanti-terrorism police are searching his
OL,17,Fhome
OL,19,FEarlier, a police spokesperson says the
OL,20,Fsuspect was "wearing military-style
OL,21,Fattire" and "used military weapons"
